  {'t': 'Confirm it meets the criteria shown on the form.', 'd': "Off-cycle runs are for real hardship cases, so the form lists criteria. Examples: more than 25% of salary missing, a time card issue, or the $200 gross threshold. If it doesn't meet them, the amount will pay in the next regular payroll."},
  {'t': 'Submit the form.', 'd': 'Note the date and time you submitted so you can follow up.'},
