  {'t': 'Click Add.', 'd': 'Add opens a blank document record with Document Type at the top.'},
  {'t': 'Document Type: pick the type that matches.', 'd': "Open the Document Type list and choose the type (see the table below). The page then shows the type's Category and a Description that lists what it covers and the naming convention to use."},
  {'t': 'Name: use the naming convention shown in the description.', 'd': 'Type the name exactly as the description shows, for example "Written Warning - Discipline" or "Performance Review - (review dates)". Consistent names make records easy to find and report on.'},
